  "body_markdown": "Book Appointment\n\n\n### Referring Doctors\n\n\nThank you for entrusting us with the care of your patients!\n\nYou may refer patients to our office by filling out our secure online Referral Form. The security and privacy of patient data is one of our primary concerns and we have taken every precaution to protect it.\n\nIf you have any questions, please CALL US at (310) 315-1034 and select OPTION 3 for a direct and immediate transfer to our patient treatment coordinators. You may also TEXT US at (310) 315-0025.\n\nWe look forward to partnering with you to provide exceptional care for your patients!\n\nOnline Referral Form\n\n\n### Ready to Transform Your Smile? Schedule Your Beverly Hills Consultation Today\n\n\nDon't let dental concerns hold you back from the confidence and oral health you deserve. Our Beverly Hills location offers the same exceptional care that has made us the premier choice for oral surgery in West Los Angeles and Beverly Hills for 50 years.\n\nBook Your Beverly Hills Appointment\n\n\n##### Ready to Transform Your Smile? Schedule Your Beverly Hills Consultation Today\n\n\n\n##### Ready to Transform Your Smile? Schedule Your Beverly Hills Consultation Today\n\n\n\n#### Location\n\n\nWe'd love to hear from you. Contact us today!\n\n\n##### Email\n\n\nSend us an email\n\ninfo@santamonicaoms.com\n\n\n##### Address\n\n\n2001 Wilshire Blvd, Ste. 600\n\nSanta Monica, CA 90403\n\n\n##### Phone\n\n\nGive us a call\n\n(310) 315-1034\n\n\n#### Office Hours\n\n\nClosed on Sunday and public holidays.\n\nMonday\n\nTuesday\n\nWednesday\n\nThursday\n\nFriday\n\nSaturday\n\nSunday\n\n7 am - 5 pm\n\n7 am - 4:30 pm\n\nClosed\n\n\n#### Location\n\n\n\n##### Email\n\n\n\n##### Address\n\n\n\n##### Phone\n\n\n\n#### Office Hours\n\n\n\n###### Email\n\n\n\n###### Address\n\n\n\n###### Phone\n\n\n\n###### Office Hours\n\n\nLocation\n\n\n###### About Us\n\n\nAbout Us\n\nOur Surgeons\n\nOur Office\n\nTestimonials\n\nBlog\n\nReferring Doctors\n\n\n###### Procedures\n\n\nOrthognathic (jaw) Surgery\n\nSedation Dentistry\n\nSinus Lift\n\nFacial Trauma\n\nTeeth-in-an-Hour™\n\nAll-on-four Dental Implants\n\nDental Implants\n\nWisdom Teeth Removal\n\n\n###### For Patients\n\n\nPay Your Bill\n\nFirst Visit\n\nPatient Registration\n\nFinancial Information\n\nBefore Anesthesia\n\nAfter Dental Implant Surgery\n\nAfter Tooth Extraction\n\nAfter Wisdom Tooth Surgery\n\nAfter Exposure Of An Impacted Tooth\n\nAfter The Removal Of Multiple Teeth\n\nJaw Fracture\n\nOrthognathic Surgery\n\nSinus Augmentation\n\n© 2025 Santa Monica Center. All rights reserved.\n\nWebsite by\n\n7Seas\n\n\n###### About Us\n\n\n\n###### Procedures\n\n\n\n###### For Patients\n\n\n\n###### About Us\n\n\n\n###### Procedures\n\n\n\n###### For Patients",
